+**Contract re-confirmation (Task 11 §1-3) — re-read, not assumed from
+Task 9/10's notes.** `apps/site-report/gas/src/models/SubmitReportInput.ts`,
+`SubmitReportService.parseSubmitReportInput`, and `Api.ts`'s
