                     Next.js Web App (apps/site-report/web)
                                 │
                ┌────────────────┴────────────────┐
                │                                  │
                ▼                                  ▼
        LINE profile (LIFF SDK,               GAS Web App
        runs in the browser)             (apps/site-report/gas)
                │                                  │
                │                    ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
                │                    ▼             ▼             ▼
                │              Google Sheets  Google Drive    Gmail
                │              (SITES/REPORTS/  (report      (admin
